  6140  4923 48                         PHA                     ; save s33
  6141  4924 ad0e50                     LDA AES_STATE+11
  6142  4927 8d1250                     STA AES_STATE+15
  6143  492a ad0a50                     LDA AES_STATE+7
  6144  492d 8d0e50                     STA AES_STATE+11
