  6303  4a41 8dff4f                     STA AES_BLOCK+12
  6304  4a44 ad3552                     LDA AES_CTR_CNT+1
  6305  4a47 8d0050                     STA AES_BLOCK+13
  6306  4a4a ad3652                     LDA AES_CTR_CNT+2
