  7259                          ; Rotate/shift on fixed scratch word SHA_TA (8 bytes, LE)
  7260                          ;   SHA_N = number of bits.  ROTR_TA = rotate right; SHR_TA = shift right.
  7261                          ; ================================================================
  7262                          ; --- 1-bit right rotation of SHA_TA (LE) ---
