  7773  7c9d 85fb                       STA PA
  7774  7c9f 9002                       BCC SB_UH1
  7775  7ca1 e6fc                       INC PA+1
  7776  7ca3 a5fd               SB_UH1  LDA PB
  7777  7ca5 18                         CLC
