     4                          ;   Per step k=42..0: ACC=2*ACC ; idx (5 bits) from teeth signs relative to
     5                          ;   tooth0 ; load +/-TABLE[idx] ; ACC += point.  43 doublings.
     6                          ;   6 teeth at bit offsets 0,43,86,129,172,215 (W=43).  6*43=258 > 257 so the
     7                          ;   top tooth reaches bits 256/257 for k=41/42 -> CB_POS is 16-bit.
     8                          ;   Recode forces bit257 (= NB-1).  Validated byte-exact vs n*B.
